		{"id":"4722ef1c183d3d83","type":"text","text":"## Tipos de modelos\n\n| Tipo de Modelo | Nombre Completo                 |\n| :------------- | :------------------------------ |\n| **CIM**        | *Computation Independent Model* |\n| **PIM**        | *Platform Independent Model*    |\n| **PSM**        | *Platform Specific Model*       |\n| **IM**         | *Implementation Model*          |","x":-1482,"y":-780,"width":400,"height":240},
		{"id":"fae8868b026baf4e","type":"text","text":"## Capas\n\n| Nivel  | Rol OMG                     | Tecnologías / Ejemplos                  |\n| :----: | :-------------------------- | :-------------------------------------- |\n| **M3** | **Meta-metamodelo**         | **MOF** (*Meta-Object Facility*)        |\n| **M2** | **Metamodelo**              | UML, Metamodelo Relacional, CWM         |\n| **M1** | **Modelo (*User Model*)**   | Diagrama de clases de una aplicación    |\n| **M0** | **Instancias (*Run-Time*)** | Datos en memoria / Objetos en ejecución |","x":-400,"y":-740,"width":512,"height":240},
